{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiply or Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/ezgif.com-resize__1_.gif?t=1739272194\" />Cannon Royale is a game about strategy and luck. The goal is to destroy the enemy cannons and be the last survivor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Card based gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/Card_Wave_GIF_2.gif?t=1739272194\" />Spin the wheel in order to get cards that will help you throughout the game. Cards can give you extra bullets, shields, multipliers, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pachinko-style Ball Mechanism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/ezgif.com-resize__2_.gif?t=1739272194\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The pachinko-style mechanism on the side of each player determines how many bullets to shoot.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Ball lands on x2:</strong> Double your shots </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Ball lands on R:</strong> Release all your shots </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/how_works_again.gif?t=1739272194\" />Customize your cannon with different colors and designs. Customize your territory however you like it by painting in a pixel-art style.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2064830?t=1739272194","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739272194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739272194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739272194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2564980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiply or Release</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/ezgif.com-resize__1_.gif?t=1739272194\" />Cannon Royale is a game about strategy and luck. The goal is to destroy the enemy cannons and be the last survivor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Card based gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/Card_Wave_GIF_2.gif?t=1739272194\" />Spin the wheel in order to get cards that will help you throughout the game. Cards can give you extra bullets, shields, multipliers, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pachinko-style Ball Mechanism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2064830/extras/ezgif.com-resize__2_.gif?t=1739272194\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The pachinko-style mechanism on the side of each player determines how many bullets to shoot.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Ball lands on x2:</strong> Double your shots </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph